Description: BOSS Health — System Readiness with integrated BOSS-Sentinel
 BOSS Health is the System Readiness application for BOSS GNU/Linux
 (Cinnamon). Click the panel applet to run Connectivity (Repository,
 ISOC, Network), System Health (CPU, RAM, Disk, Overall via the
 existing BOSS-Sentinel collectors), and Services (Critical, Security)
 checks, then open a professional readiness dashboard.
 Also installs the full BOSS-Sentinel monitor (boss-sentinel).
